## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
Severity: MEDIUM  
AMD is fab-lite, dependent on foundries like TSMC, exposing it to supply chain risks. Its CapEx cycle is aligned with data center demand, which is stable but subject to macroeconomic headwinds. Customer concentration in data centers is high, reducing diversification.  

